        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: the actress who played Dr. Leslie Thompkins, Kenneth Johnson\n- TV Shows: Gotham, V, Rogues' Gallery\n- Roles: Dr. Leslie Thompkins\n- Concepts: Brazilian American nationality, remake, 1983 science fiction miniseries\n\nFacts:\n- Kenneth Johnson created the 1983 science fiction miniseries V.\n- A remake of V was later produced.\n- The actress who played Dr. Leslie Thompkins in Gotham also starred in the remake of V.\n- The actress who played Dr. Leslie Thompkins is Brazilian American.\n- Dr. Leslie Thompkins appeared in Gotham, which is also referred to here as Rogues' Gallery.",
