        "original_id": "93bf8195-351a-5229-8354-ccb7eeea7810",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: V (2009 TV series), Rogues' Gallery\n- People: Kenneth Johnson, Elizabeth Mitchell, Morena Baccarin, Scott Rosenbaum, Yves Simoneau, Scott Peters, Steve Pearlman, Jace Hall, Ben McKenzie\n- Roles: actress, executive producers\n- Concepts: alien species, Arkham Asylum\n\nFacts:\n- Kenneth Johnson created the 1983 miniseries that V (2009 TV series) remade.\n- V (2009 TV series) chronicles the arrival on Earth of a technologically advanced alien species that appears peaceful but actually has sinister motives.\n- V (2009 TV series) stars Elizabeth Mitchell and Morena Baccarin.\n- Scott Rosenbaum, Yves Simoneau, Scott Peters, Steve Pearlman, and Jace Hall served as executive producers of V (2009 TV series).\n- Morena Silva de Vaz Setta Baccarin, born on June 2, 1979, is a Brazilian American actress.\n- In the Gotham episode Rogues' Gallery, Gordon, played by Ben McKenzie, is transferred to Arkham Asylum and tries to avoid a conflict during an inmate riot with help from Dr. Leslie Thompkins, played by Morena Baccarin.",
